{"id":"n62270-1-9","stage":1,"title":"라면 · 方便面","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62270-1-9-1","ko":"점심에 뭘 먹지?","zh":"午饭吃什么好呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"점심에","meaning":"中饭，午饭，午餐","explanation":"점심：中饭，午饭，午餐；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"1","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점심에","audio":"/audio/986cc2e503e6256b1f53.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"먹지?","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹지","audio":"/audio/459814465f88e153b13c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"12cf30d1ce4feda7","term":"점심","zh":"中饭，午饭，午餐","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3","entryId":"70868","definition":"早餐和晚餐之间，白天吃的饭。","pronunciation":["점ː심"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/21e00a170ee6c82250ff.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62270-1-9-2","ko":"라면 끓여서 국물에 밥 말아 먹자.","zh":"煮点拉面，再把米饭泡进汤里吃吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"라면","meaning":"方便面","explanation":"라면：方便面。","readings":[{"term":"라면","audio":"/audio/6454befbdb61c843cbd2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62270","senseI