474","definition":"把食物放进水或液体里加热，制作食品。","pronunciation":["끄리다"]},{"id":"28fc4f685e87f9f4","term":"국물","zh":"汤水，汤汁","audio":"/audio/28fc4f685e87f9f4926f.mp3","entryId":"64512","definition":"在清汤或浓汤等食物里，除去汤料以外剩下的水。","pronunciation":["궁물"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"在大米或其他谷物中倒入水后煮干至熟的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"泡饭","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"51701","definition":"把米饭放入汤汁中泡开；本句指用拉面汤泡饭。","pronunciation":["말다"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ff3e949cd1103214df39.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.933,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62270","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":34,"sequenceScore":1.5306,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["煮点拉面，再把米饭泡进汤里吃吧。","午饭吃什么好呢？","听说那家生了第二个孩子，是儿子还是女儿？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["午饭吃什么好呢？","听说那家生了第二个孩子，是儿子还是女儿？","煮点拉面，再把米饭泡进汤里吃吧。"],"answer":2}]}
